35,2,1,talk,Mio,,Transport is 38% of the cost if we go far. That is huge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The canteen closes, so we cooked for two hours a day last year.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Inland clubs slept eight to a room. Lights out at eleven.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Public beds are 1,100 yen a night. That is cheaper than I thought.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if public beds are cheap, why did we overspend last year?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, eight to a room sounds terrible. Did they train well?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the cooking duty was the biggest time sink. We need staff.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, I don't care about the room size if I can sleep properly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, if we use a place with kitchen staff, we save time.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,Whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. That is risky for dropouts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,A fifth of the membership never came to the last away camp.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The campus hall is booked by three other clubs. We can't get a block.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,A third of the club can't be here by nine without a bed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The transport receipts confirm the distance is the main cost driver.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am worried about the financial risk of the coastal lodge.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"If we stay local, we lose the chance to mix with other years.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The campus option is too fragmented. We need a dedicated space.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"The inland option has strict rules, but it is a real training centre.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The public rate sheet is the most predictable budget-wise.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
